  "descriptionHtml": "<p data-end=\"261\" data-start=\"175\"><strong data-end=\"259\" data-start=\"175\">2019 Centurion Fi23 Clean, Powerful, and Ready for Your Best Year on the Water</strong></p><p data-end=\"575\" data-start=\"263\">Turn heads on the water with this meticulously maintained <strong data-end=\"344\" data-start=\"321\">2019 Centurion Fi23</strong> a premium performance boat that delivers world-class wakes and unmatched versatility for wakeboarding, wake surfing, and all-around family fun. <strong>Only 246 hours on its PCM ZR4 (6.0L, 409HP) </strong>motor; this Fi23 has plenty of adventures left in her..</p><p data-end=\"1422\" data-start=\"577\"><strong data-end=\"600\" data-start=\"577\">Why You'll Love It:</strong><br data-end=\"603\" data-start=\"600\" /><strong data-end=\"634\" data-start=\"606\">Premium Wake Performance</strong> Centurion engineering means deep, perfectly shaped wakes that riders rave about. This isn't just a boat it's a confidence-inspiring surf and ride machine.<br data-end=\"796\" data-start=\"793\" /><strong data-end=\"817\" data-start=\"798\">Efficient Beast</strong> 246 hours on the engine translates to many seasons of trusted reliability without being broken-in. Ready to take on big days with fuel-efficient power.<br /><strong data-end=\"1010\" data-start=\"979\">Intuitive Control &amp; Comfort</strong> Easy to drive with responsive handling and thoughtfully designed ergonomics for a smoother ride.<br data-end=\"1112\" data-start=\"1109\" /><strong data-end=\"1132\" data-start=\"1115\">Room for Crew</strong> Excellent seating layout to fit 14 passengers with comfort, convenience, and style ideal for gatherings, families, and crew rotations.<br /><strong data-end=\"1293\" data-start=\"1274\">Well-Maintained</strong> Clean interior and exterior condition with documented care and attention to detail. This boat has been loved and looked after.</p><p data-end=\"1453\" data-start=\"1424\"><strong data-end=\"1451\" data-start=\"1424\">Performance &amp; Features:</strong></p><ul data-end=\"1749\" data-start=\"1454\">\t<li data-end=\"1519\" data-start=\"1454\">\t<p data-end=\"1519\" data-start=\"1456\">Centerline length: 23 ideal balance of playful and stable</p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1572\" data-start=\"1520\">\t<p data-end=\"1572\" data-start=\"1522\">Powerful engine with low hours long life ahead</p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1642\" data-start=\"1573\">\t<p data-end=\"1642\" data-start=\"1575\">Wake shaping tech built in beginner-friendly to pro-level wakes</p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1696\" data-start=\"1643\">\t<p data-end=\"1696\" data-start=\"1645\">Modern audio and comfort features for onboard fun</p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1749\" data-start=\"1697\">\t<p data-end=\"1749\" data-start=\"1699\">Integrated ballast for customizable surf/wake size</p>\t</li></ul><p data-end=\"1934\" data-start=\"1751\">Whether you're chasing perfect waves, towing riders of all skill levels, or hosting friends for a sunset cruise, the <strong data-end=\"1886\" data-start=\"1868\">Centurion Fi23</strong> delivers performance, reliability, and style.</p>",
